<title>MOLDOVA: Moldova 28-, 91-day T-bills down, 273-day steady.</title>
<headline>Moldova 28-, 91-day T-bills down, 273-day steady.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The annualised yield on Moldovan 28-day Treasury bills fell to 25.25 percent on Tuesday from 27.96 percent at the previous auction on April 1, the National Bank said late on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The yield on 91-day T-bills eased to 28.34 percent from 28.8 percent on April 1.</p>
<p>The yield on 273-day T-bills remained steady at 30.15 percent from March 25.</p>
<p>Full details of the 28-day T-bill auction--</p>
